  "minutes": 35,
  "recap": "Welcome to Day 24 of Quantitative & Low-Latency Systems Engineering. Today we enter the physical domain of ultra-high-frequency trading where the speed of light in silica glass, fiber spool equalization laws, and cut-through switches determine order arrival precedence.",
